lpd@feenix.metronet.com (Lou Dellaverson) writes:

>I am randomly teleporting around each level. I think it is because I 
>ate a leprachun(sp?). How do I stop????

Minor Spoilers...

You can't. Well almost. What's happened is that you've gained the teleport
intrinsic (by eating yon Leprechaun as you guessed). As far as I know the
only way to get rid of this intrinsic is to get hit by a gremlin, which
can steals a random intrinsic. IMHO this would be a crazy thing to do, but
it is at least possible.

Alternatively, you could be more positive, and get teleport control. This
is available either from a ring of teleport control, or by gaining the
intrinsic by eating (probably lots) tengus.

Personally I always eat a leprechaun or nymph early on in the game, but
many people do find it very annoying and so avoid them. Each to his own :-)

